'''Archbaron Face''' (ビッグカオ男爵, ''Biggu Kao Danshaku'', '''Big Baron Face''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Baron Face]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. He was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Archbaron Face
|image = E 754.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return|Ep. 5: The Archrivals' Return]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
A supersized version of [[Baron Face]], boasting far higher overall stats and a standing range of 490, outranging almost all relevant backliners including [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]]. He has a very slow attack rate of nearly 10 seconds, making this his greatest weakness!

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] won't be of much use against Archbaron Face, as their recharge rates are too slow to be consistently reliable. You're better off using rushers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to sneak in hits in between attack cycles. Treat this enemy as you would [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] in that sense, and take care to make the mastermind ''face'' his maker.

