==Trivia==
*Archbaron Face, [[High Countess Koryessa]] and [[Grand Emperor Warumongar]] are likely based on the [[wikia:powerrangers:Growing the Monsters|Growing the Monsters]] trope from the ''[[wikipedia:Super Sentai Series|Super Sentai Series]]'', in which monsters often become giant versions of themselves on the verge of defeat.

